<!-- https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/fundamentals/package-validation/diagnostic-ids -->
<!--
  Intentional, accepted breaking change: IMetadataLoader, EmbeddedResourceMetadataLoader, and
  MetadataManager.SetMetadataLoader were made public in PR #323 (v9.0.x, ~May 2026) on
  "mirrors Java's MetadataLoader API" precedent reasoning, without the explicit sign-off a new
  public member requires (see CLAUDE.md's note on new public members). No documented feature ever
  referenced them (not in README/CHANGELOG/docs), and internally they were always just the
  implementation detail behind MetadataSource/PhoneNumberUtil's internal constructors, so this
  reverts them to internal rather than waiting for the next major version bump — which, since this
  library's major version tracks upstream Google libphonenumber's, could be years away.
-->
